                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Meyer to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St.
                                Petersburg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-07-11"><hi rendition="#italic">July 11,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Meyer transmits a telegram from the American consul at Moscow reporting the
                    assassination of Count Souvaloff, chief of police, and the apprehension of the
                    assassin.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
